// Questionnaire_Answer_Change is a handle to gpui_kit::base::questionnaire::QuestionnaireAnswerChange, a library object the library keeps (PROTOCOLS.md section 13): a temporary handle when a read, a call or an event hands it out (gk.retain keeps it), a kept one from its constructor. Its procedures are named questionnaire_answer_change_*.
Questionnaire_Answer_Change :: struct {
	using state: State,
}

questionnaire_answer_change_answer :: proc(s: Questionnaire_Answer_Change, cx: ^Cx, loc := #caller_location) -> (v: Questionnaire_Answer_Read) {
	req := make(Tape, 0, 32, context.temp_allocator)
